---
/**
 * Full-viewport about section.
 */
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="flex min-h-dvh flex-col items-center justify-center bg-surface px-6 py-32 sm:px-8"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl text-center">
    <h2 class="text-h1 text-content uppercase mb-16">About</h2>
    <p class="text-display text-content uppercase mb-10">
      Michael Salton is a software developer and computer graphics engineer based in Montreal,
      Canada.
    </p>

    <p class="text-display text-content uppercase mb-10">
      He received his masters in computer science with a focus on real-time rendering in 2027 from
      Concordia University.
    </p>

    <p class="text-display text-content uppercase">
      He explores procedural generation, computational geometry, creative coding, and the occasional
      game prototype.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
